# Stormplain Detainment: "...exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until this enchantment leaves the battlefield." If the
# enchantment is destroyed with its trigger still on the stack (Bot2's Disenchant in response), the duration has already ended
# when the trigger resolves, so Bot2's Ornithopter is never exiled (CR 610.3b) and stays on the battlefield.

